  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd419f8b6ff8290c77c29cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有好好地\n进行成长吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2d0485846adfa27eef4258c4faf5aeb850b66a92213c048d98ce461b36699c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a53af7a8b516b96cb9d84a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴可能还差的很远\n但…我会努力的。\n…我还想，变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8326e345bc6f4a6d5b5f2820486e634adfad92a4c0b1775644917665eaccb96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddc06d7ba6c17e745e72a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的跑步很快乐。\n诶嘿嘿…想再快一点啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "394338afbcf46a5418416614c98f99c697f78fe90c935419a6e06cbfea30d97f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30196cf4cbb3052a600d0bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，拜托了。\n再多来些训练吧。\n米浴…想获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6af22f65418a634833d62d0605122beec35661b035b9b7eeafb9ed6df42fc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5022c993a3b7fc48b088e8cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，拜托了。\n再多来些训练吧。\n米浴…想获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "165205fc7ad2da30e9c182741c9ad6b394285bb6adba2061a4a3b1b67fdcf84b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b656da2850e5ac4cb38afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿…，啊！\n对，对不起，不是笑的时候吧。\n因为很高兴，所以不知不觉就…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33912d1e84d20f4f00199d33e48f5ac1b70022376e4efa52fc2ccabdbba2676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5204b49db2f5c7c200e24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发箍戴好了，翅膀穿好了，\r\n蹄铁装好了，牙齿也戴上了……\r\n嗯！准备OK了哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a60e4d74a592fd79c3d4c65566eb8ba2bea303341cee72088bdd99cc13002e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6672ba6979b5e2b6a60d7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不让我训练的话就要恶作剧了……\r\n开、开玩笑的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dad142b8831fca9bbfba85d530b2ef555d2fb0cd548d0f4a5842d5ed70d59b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5037fbb318f38d593aa3ec36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会比飞还要快的……！\r\n要加油喽——哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b28289408c5fa689a22eb995528bc35f1e170e596caca27b8592a520b4b17f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c31ae13104207ddbcff0007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Pum、Pum、Pumpkin♪\r\n南瓜小点心……\r\n啊！对对对、对不起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c57112960a3d8944ddc33344877a216153db1ceaab57604311db3bad5e1fd9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9c39174652c646a1ac63fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练结束后，想一起喝喝茶……\r\n我准备了很多点心呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9da2e644b23c543c4b7b3b68d84a1e75e7de1266dd541b6fcd436272432b8e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ab0eb927c0621e44c1a99d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像越来越快了……！\r\n不管来什么样的妖怪，\r\n我都会牵着哥哥的手逃走的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4644aa728be7aed02fdbe307794d7bd2883b294017c0aa2a2be82c115190929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d91bba82a67949615b7576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥……即使米浴真的变成了吸血鬼，\r\n你也会和我在一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01720ca20946cf23e1d1d73e71912d040d694ab7c08a287081eba00b18357d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb5322a01d7d43512cbd1c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像越来越快了……！\r\n不管来什么样的妖怪，\r\n我都会牵着姐姐的手逃走的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86b328ff6b4cc0540f5761d67540db92a0303bb210abc3c8c9512505d78f3ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:057f705726b85d5d4b056135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐……即使米浴真的变成了吸血鬼，\r\n你也会和我在一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9d139b29a30db1e5abb398d76447b3d5d7e29b445e04c0f1d784be6c58cba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d89753577ee8a7627eaca3e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多多吃饭，多多运动……\r\n然后变得更强更强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "914796da6eed744adc80f07993cfd09e34f949ffa19051f24428305b8855cf29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b0d088541bb4406f07ed274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满，气势满满！\r\n米浴，今天也要好好加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc745dd637f74067f02c783676d112d6c20bcedf767beba26999cb02e7f8f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033f61ca6c878deeae83e92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "草莓、胡萝卜♪山椒、苦瓜♪\r\n就、就只是想说说看而已……\r\n欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15f331a52847e77edbe3d82ef8663347cb33091882aa44d0f89197f8f0465af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02d91fab544bbd0b1d7fe87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰带啾地勒好了。\r\n米浴也啾地有气势了。\r\n嗯，准备OK了哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "444ad7caed9ad101596cab8acbf9649e6a0624a4e3bd2106c6abb84401bbc171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1361f0425ad4ea8adbcf6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不输给田里的蔬菜，\r\n米浴也会茁壮成长……！\r\n所以……今后也要看着米浴哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abab27d06d4b84d37b0133150976e664799e2c7d493bb91752d8ba3e97dd4b38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e7e12fdda66b227af57662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥努力的样子是米浴的\r\n精神源泉哦……！无论比赛\r\n还是料理……都有在后背支撑着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2607ff756d5348b65c59a9c306aaa76007c2ea3635f05635b0037f2d8ed987f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba75cfe50ac684dd70de4c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "培育了米浴……真的很感谢\r\n米浴一定会为哥哥献上\r\n让人目瞪口呆的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f0783750018a9e37781034cdacc73e698c66d0002f2c4a334fcced2fe48d2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b2a21258c9e0197708e6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐努力的样子是米浴的\r\n精神源泉哦……！无论比赛\r\n还是料理……都有在后背支撑着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae0bd6256bbcce544a5bfe32c79a55946bc6d81ab1dbc1954a625eca712bd77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ac15896b47a1ec772443c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "培育了米浴……真的很感谢\r\n米浴一定会为姐姐献上\r\n让人目瞪口呆的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c71543e0c0f4d57bb41016ce1d3d54412c9dba5a9f77eb9831a939535d88252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128ad7a48a316f72fd94260f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为有哥哥陪着，我才会站在这里…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6059ca3cafce450593ea9873e560006a3942507f3f3aab65a233da6cda4971cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59234bb63bf63b175209bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为有姐姐陪着，我才会站在这里…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3637d2d709d76a1b2eeb319a1ee848f8e665897106a0838a17c5464684803483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df3057e750a55ed9f282396",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，接近想要成为的自己了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4edbfb6acfdf55b9aa5434326968c1c0b5b46a25f2851a1fce54f7dec7cee0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca387525d9f9285b0974ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使活在永恒的时间里，\r\n也不会忘记的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a9fe5218550e2af8a873431bb0bf83152793e21dc1000f685638bcc75f73f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bc31bcab8c85d45f708a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和平常不一样的米浴……\r\n感觉怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b60b405c900344e5bd06ffb627c0688768c0b902348a7411a11e2951989679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae567987d314420ce2ca99a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴和大家做的特制料理……完成了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1a44dd93051582b4fcf063994bb852e24c9a03e1468f06b4c1b1b0c0cf0078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affae28675124c5e7845a24d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是多亏了哥哥的菜单哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2f4443dbcae11961c1133f25903b9cae71ac1fcc5f11fa3201c977da67495d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf26d7190f534fd2c9f7a6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是多亏了姐姐的菜单哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "73cd41d16223e247712841f2fcc300f8cc259e8c9c7f61fbe358356438fde806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15abd11681cc09582a43c462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微，变强一点了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2602a84a1efcbd2720eb398e737b28a6949feb577eab6388ab4d05cb19099be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b00e9377c02fe1bb02e1dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果和哥哥一起的话，那么米浴也…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3465810817e470feb63d7792d387288397a6b75631762ced4b8a63165484af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3cf2cddde16d2d17e5a10b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀，呀…！是米浴哦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8cebca1fc955a3afbfce7f8b6cb47d79228916b0dd018e3a6050a249f42e32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377788ee7fdc26983d861090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想让大家变得幸福…\n米浴，出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f50201cfa1eda5a6022bfcf86b46ba4e68825e812cc0f5801bfaab8f5764b0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87886ffdddd73aa4c0772a5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就能派上用场了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a919224bf31f3dcb23a4b72ad962b13e96563166bfd9fdabb2ebe69d48bc45da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92365a1c1b941e9ede57b34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，会更帮上更多忙的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46160ca85db9d4e72ce16a79e2e3172ae1236975bb7cc0a3aabbaab1c25b03ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad3565fbbf2bc518c09777c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，我变强了——！\r\n……欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e5a1930c83853484434c79fadf92469c0acd397c833a5a6caeb5d4c4eceafb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c32a12548b5750269fa92bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞬间大成功……什么的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8aa86298652ed98fae754e94e4c0f7c7e5e77fd3d78c3da3e3ea0033d96d874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:427db071f3f6632ff691894f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被咬的话会很痛……\r\n要咬住的，只有胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a0873ebd4d6115ecb032c4614bcb86535c1009c77885d441facd7ac2aa58b31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e732aae89c49e6d39872fd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是米浴……！\r\n那个……要、要咬你了哦~……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4062f8f98989069ea9b57fd3e65a2b4a5a07f5fbc8c1e1cb84628739e5ecf999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:120a8ee2cfe315fec54b83c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果和姐姐一起的话，那么米浴也…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "326b84e5e19458f55ecb7c714c698a024d5a4c94032953c538547b45e2954b63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f32fe78577d8b2a97e07ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晒晒日光浴……\r\n悠哉游哉地舒展身体吧……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ac4d24fb8b705eec2c6882011bd357a8332e4cad31456c6c2d9a1909aa9916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72c78affa1e4bbdef9b81a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿……三星级的rice做好啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42491617fea1bfd1ed093641e6a3b4305ef9d5aa41ebc09382502e78883a7cab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0c252b92eec65c4e7de1f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美食和幸福……\r\n为大家送去吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0a36a94c67db2d976c77f138179e1cd83e58ed2bfaacd97c6361465b76cc75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fac1cff438010cf5bf87ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……会真心实意加油的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fcc38d87ed4c3a940890dbd80b97094cddd2aab7e4f690ae303dbd0921f891b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f177237e07dac50b26853cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25dbfb13b40c8646a6c9756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有家人的支持，\r\n还有训练员在一旁守护我……\r\n啊哈，我真是个幸福的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ef8e580c9aa9280e14a01fcd3908fa8e2e5dc5545820f7cde1082e7cf4b6513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe83f19a05985265bedab36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d6f218982d23fee6f2308745ae768ea9715cf6d2ad9389ea44c7fd793e234c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492d00919940e6d549decce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまなの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0480fb3163fbe1f9ebb22d19e371df79a555d86a490911c1cac8065ff8c7213d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:333392ae66c9b8153a2c21ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想支持我，\r\n我想支持你！\r\n不觉得我们是对好搭档吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fce0ad88d638ea2fcd7ccc35899e5eef922443e990f5371f39ad95b34bedf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e43dacdd09b922e8b1149f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使少根筋，或是有点冒失……\r\n其实都无所谓。\r\n你认真的样子很帅气！就是这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "204ae48763037d530781e60c7d018401f141a9ef139c2fb54c2b4f6a67fd4b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f4ad64b51191af6973c552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n虽然有点赶，但快点准备一下！\r\n我们要直接去新年特卖了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f77cace931e0c6312dd5c2347338869931be4a702c98d4cfb7875a97c7107d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e97f148bd8b23f35ae8c1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年按照惯例，宿舍的房间里\r\n都会收到一堆巧克力！我今年也会\r\n和小赖恩一起努力制作回礼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4bc112af495b9bf4d9ec330aee0eaecfbb0ba991f07e446b74b0e9dd7a3674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bef856703d4449e0baf2fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，我有准备你的份！\r\n是就算正忙着工作或跑步！\r\n也能一只手拿着吃的巧克力棒喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8acaa6b9f853b2643ad3472058f45e8356a30c8f2fca924faed755149f01908e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6efeef76ac5f9bc91b2f792a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小太阳神在短签写了\r\n「有够神！」……\r\n意思是希望过得开心吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9335d0b7f5bd72ce5e0c9a6e46998244831c09ca57ea5b3bae3c58cea70257be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:014e5beadefea98c4d2bb2b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前万圣节曾经忘记替妹妹们\r\n准备点心，于是她们就开始捣蛋……\r\n被逼看恐怖电影，真的很惨耶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ff4f33c7b651574ecc1ca5cee604cfc90e0d25ccfd2c48d1b9562a77109ce59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab9f25e88f15c8bed3325e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "安静、迅速、小心别吵醒人！\r\n……这是圣诞老人前辈给你的建议。\r\n训练员以后要好好活用喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b372c56314101147e5de2debab4d1712121e3b92c4272ac89fae88bd6a42be2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92f044a1a1b76b2a48132652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人会来找乖孩子♪\r\n所以说，你要吃能量棒吗？\r\n这是圣诞节限定口味喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9748ac91191e13c44abe31bc7f075de73b98cc385488a21732f681065c8346f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4fb02772d919fc38ed8a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41e6e154d3ebed2e95663fb9fc045807325f8d36ae2978674a71ecbc4b6b2bdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7633655ecfa2df74387ca0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～！因为大扫除的关系\r\n害我的手都冻僵了！\r\n要摸摸看吗？很冰喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed93c36a768138a5ceb17fcf74fb5b78b75b02352277e92006e350953e3fc2e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47e4de709dea7ea32d8b94b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n训练员又长大一岁了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f00bf1ad3826264bfff0293b160283a77c90a5062f477b6f2eb02269dfe5677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce0be37230c32489dca3818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么想做的事情吗？\r\n今天是特别的日子～就算是有点\r\n任性的要求，我也会帮你实现♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "99814f0d98e945177431d6884b91e1edf0eb00a6337ab611d83c2ede83c23ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:608bd9138a062f29626b0f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才心想小赖恩起床了，\r\n结果她就对我说「生日快乐！」……\r\n讨厌，她的爽朗实在太耀眼了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da4bfaf383124034999a90f914aba8d2ab66e5338eb40eb2f91a43911bad4fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4644893a8e1601ad0774158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，你问我生日想要什么？嗯……\r\n一时想不到呢！对不起！\r\n那个……可以陪我一起去挑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf422c34e538d8572d434108c00170389f7cd73d64e934a22b6714d7ebd8358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac21feea19e4c29f7a87faa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告喔！\r\n啊，如果有什么优惠情报，\r\n要立刻告诉我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0e3de92d5f4f9ba6c181fa0248b9ed8ad27e78f7afd7032609e66490482f372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a0bc92aab6d08ca8689fd6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了！\r\n一起确认里面的内容吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a13dd65e6156035054d9942bc19ac2e9ef82b6d6419ad36adcdfc72ac382456e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ffd337d68efcbbc8c001fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成～！\r\n嗯～领取报酬时，\r\n总是会让人感到很兴奋呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4600f6c9cc8ce6b8171e530cae86d9fbe6e5555827635219911689d6a65839e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae92dc6ca0dc3f013c64708",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在准备活动呢！\r\n欸嘿嘿，现在就开始期待了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "542834530513e57ac6ab223a36f9c071e490fdeff3ed74067cfe9b3a76110046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce977a6cb01884cc560b88c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始啰！\r\n动作快动作快～！\r\n这种时候绝对不能落后～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36294098dbfcf1ef4724ec046c040f683cee79f60d94cd17531d2c41313a091a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fdaa88378bff3514ac8c0ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不甘心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3ea038988fbe4a3284e3250afdc47db6faa8a2201d9e4493100f9fe2450325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee5081c440cac81ac9cf979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提～升！\r\n很厉害嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "67cec2e4eab0e9d8ad53545266eb6d8b5c9dfd79be22131d092eac8250f94ee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5a0386d235c482295f2f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングにお出かけに、\r\nバイトに遊びになんでもこなせる\r\nオールラウンドな服でしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1060d2c1da30b0cf586dc7f421685d334388d8a0a9cfde055f9ae3667b6c59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29d8401a4df6be7a9ff66bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オシャレって身近な人から\r\n影響受けるんだよね…お姉ちゃん\r\nとして、もっと気を使うべき…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d069ab7e9b7cb16056f28034fee834a5175fd37b249a39eb8b374c4275123ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bedd47d7194260482fd6ab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時計はなにげに必需品！\r\n働くのなら時間を常に知れるほうが\r\n効率よく動けるから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10adfab86cbcc39ec365386b9c249ecad52e23fdb14fd23eff9b6e00b645c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9192ee38cbc3ae7150a3743a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b006d30655de8bf61a4acc65f209794ac0c1189cea0b19bf85a09590a16e5a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5470adca918c49763238bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都很帅气喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "097310d17bed48b34944087c125700078a7aa696e76cd54af1f136515091c137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c09a35e14b049a5e7014f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不甘心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3ea038988fbe4a3284e3250afdc47db6faa8a2201d9e4493100f9fe2450325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2bda7b80152e82406d375b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b006d30655de8bf61a4acc65f209794ac0c1189cea0b19bf85a09590a16e5a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
